Minimal textured artwork of soft cream linen (#F4EDE0) gradually warming toward pale apricot at the bottom, with a single thin red (#C8372D) cross-stitch zigzag line sweeping gently across the lower third. Low evening light comes from the right side, with faint ink-dark (#1C1A24) shadow softness at the edges and fine fabric grain. The upper 30% stays serene and uncluttered. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups